{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>ונסתם</b> — a place name. Jonathan ben Uzziel translated: ונסתם גיא הרי — and it will be stopped up. And all the people of the East read ונסתם like נסתם ארץ (Genesis 26:15), and behold there will be a great earthquake." "<b>ובא</b> — then the Shekhinah will come with the holy ones, who are the angels, and dwell in Jerusalem. This is the meaning of 'with you' — with Jerusalem, for 'with it' is the subject at the beginning of the section."], :book :zechariah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Zecharia -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/zecharya"] ["1" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=25&perek=5&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:47:00.494180384Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}